    "title": "Clock",
    "description": "Clock combines all of the functionality you need into one simple, beautiful package.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        1. Set alarms, add timers, and run a stopwatch\r\n\r\n        2. Keep track of time around the world using World Clock\r\n\r\n        3. Set a bedtime schedule, listen to sleep sounds, and see your upcoming events\r\n\r\n        4. Pair with a Wear OS device to bring your alarms and timers to your wrist with saved tiles or watch face complications",
